{"name": "Split Brain Samsara", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Split Brain Samsara</strong>, you and a friend control the same character. One controls the character\u2019s movements and interactions with the physical world, while the other sees different things and interacts with the spiritual realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together, you must try to escape a massive station, understand what happened to you, and choose your fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370210/extras/51c4a8171025b57a7c5a2e57a0483506.avif?t=1779973845\" width=\"1080\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370210/extras/29603abb15510f7eb897ecd0bf248005.poster.avif?t=1779973845\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370210/extras/29603abb15510f7eb897ecd0bf248005.webm?t=1779973845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370210/extras/29603abb15510f7eb897ecd0bf248005.mp4?t=1779973845\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every part of the station to figure out what happened: where are the people who used to live here? What were you doing here? Why are there two of you in one body?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4370210/extras/b973fb670493f41d42590fee11eb2f78.avif?t=1779973845\" width=\"1080\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video auto